{
    "title": "myStop\u00ae Mobile",
    "description": "myStop\u00ae Mobile puts real-time bus information and trip planning in your hands. Quickly and easily access interactive location and schedule information for more than 39 public transit agencies across the US.\r\n\r\nmyStop\u00ae Mobile has been updated to bring you improved performance and usability with an enhanced look & feel.  Use myStop\u00ae Mobile for:\r\n\r\n\u2014 Trip planning enhanced by Google Search\r\n\u2014 Easily setting routes/stops as favorites\r\n\u2014 Quick access to service alerts\r\n\u2014 Integrated email & SMS notifications \u2014 so you don\u2019t miss your bus\r\n\u2014 Navigation to the nearest stop\r\n\u2014 Real-time graphical bus tracking \u2014 see where your bus is on the map\r\n\u2014 Determining bus capacity \u2014 so you can ride in comfort\r\n\r\nmyStop\u00ae Mobile automatically loads the participating agency that is closest to your current location.\r\nAgencies currently using myStop\u00ae Mobile include: \r\n\r\nAcadia National Park\r\nACC Transit (Athens, GA)\r\nAMTRAN (Altoona, PA)\r\nAntelope Valley \u2013 AVTA (Lancaster, CA)\r\nAtomic City Transit \u2013 ACT (Los Alamos, NM)\r\nBARTA (Reading, PA)\r\nButler Transit (Butler, PA)\r\nCamtran (Johnstown, PA)\r\nCATA Bus (State College, PA)\r\nCollier County (Naples, FL)\r\nCOLTS (Scranton, PA)\r\nCitrus Connection (Lakeland, FL)\r\nErie, PA\r\nGwinnett County, GA\r\nHDPT (Harrisonburg, PA)\r\nHazleton, PA\r\nIndiGO (Indiana, PA)\r\nIndyGo (Indianapolis, IN)\r\nKMetro (Kalamazoo, MI)\r\nLANTA (Allentown, PA)\r\nLebanon Transit (Lebanon, PA)\r\nLextran (Lexington, KY)\r\nMAX Transit (Birmingham, AL)\r\nMAX (Modesto, CA)\r\nMETRO (Akron, OH)\r\nMCAT (Manatee County, Florida)\r\nMontebello Bus Lines (Montebello, CA)\r\nMonroe County \u2013 MCTA, Pocono Pony (Scotrun, PA)\r\nNapa \u2013 Vine (Napa, CA)\r\nNCRTD Blue Bus (Los Alamos, NM)\r\nNorwalk, CT\r\nPalmTran (West Palm Beach, FL)\r\nPark City, UT\r\nPetaluma, CA\r\nPVTA (Springfield, MA)\r\nRabbit Transit (York, PA)\r\nThe Rapid (Grand Rapids, MI)\r\nRiver Valley Transit (Williamsport, PA)\r\nRed Rose Transit Authority \u2013 RRTA (Lancaster, PA)\r\nSanta Rosa, CA\r\nSARTA (Canton, OH)\r\nSolTrans (Vallejo, CA)\r\nSunline Transit (Thousand Palms, CA)\r\nSuntran (Ocala, FL)\r\nSTS (Lebanon, PA)\r\nSVSS (Shenango Valley, PA)\r\nVotran (Volusia County, FL)\r\nTCAT (Ithaca, NY)\r\nThe Wave (Mobile, AL)\r\nWichita, KS\r\nWRTA (Youngstown, OH)",
